{"title":"Sunday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/925813496/0/marginalrevolution~Sunday-assorted-links.html","date":1759681480000,"content":"<p>1.  “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=5549618\" target=\"_blank\">Accurately accounting for that misreporting may reduce rather than increase top shares of income.</a>”</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2025/10/03/us/billionaire-marc-rowan-trump-deal-universities.html\" target=\"_blank\">Marc Rowan and the universities</a> (NYT).</p>\r\n<p>3. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.thecut.com/article/how-to-find-time-to-read-books.html?utm_source=facebook&amp;utm_medium=s1&amp;utm_campaign=nym\" target=\"_blank\">Book people are going to be incensed by this, but I often listen while I am playing speed chess. I also often listen somewhere between 1.5 and 2.5x.</a>”</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.straitstimes.com/multimedia/graphics/2025/09/singapore-hawker-signs/index.html\" target=\"_blank\">Insights about Singapore hawker centre signs</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. “The economist Tyler Cowen wrote that <em>Average Is Over</em>. It would be a bigger threat to civic peace if even <em>Far Above Average Is Over</em>.” (<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ft.com/content/0fc44c6b-277c-4472-a235-65f59a9195f3\" target=\"_blank\">FT</a>)</p>\r\n<p>6.<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0166046225000742\" target=\"_blank\"> How does being part of a historic district affect the value of your home?</a></p>\r\n<p>7. By no means do I agree with <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/1974513628385804573?s=61\" target=\"_blank\">all of this</a>, but if you are looking for a different take on Fed independence…</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/sunday-assorted-links-536.html\">Sunday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/925813496/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/925813496/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/925813496/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/925813496/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/925813496/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/925813496/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/sunday-assorted-links-536.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/sunday-assorted-links-536.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/sunday-assorted-links-536.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/sunday-assorted-links-536.html#comment-160971195\">In reply to Scott H..   